message: "If you use ClaimBound Evidence, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "ClaimBound Evidence"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Shcherbyna"
    given-names: "Rostyslav"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.4.7.4"
date-released: "2026-09-24"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ClaimBound/claimbound-evidence"
abstract: >-
  Evidence cards, a validator and a static registry for bounded, reproducible claims
  about public data and software. Cards record protocol, sources, hashes, result status,
  claim boundary and reproduction level; raw payloads are never committed.
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - evidence
  - open science
  - provenance
